ivas de investiga&#x000e7;&#x000e3;o cient&#x000ed;fica: hansen&#x000ed;ase.</article-title><source>Revista Brasileira de Epidemiologia.</source><year>2002</year>;<volume>5</volume>:<fpage>273</fpage>&#x02013;<lpage>85</lpage> <pub-id pub-id-type="doi">10.1590/S1415-790X2002000300006</pub-id></citation></ref></ref-list></back></article>